// LABELED WEAKNESS: interchangeable character voices. Alex, Jordan, and
// Casey are given different jobs and different opinions on paper, but all
// three share the same clipped hedging cadence ("I mean," "Honestly,"
// "Kind of," short sentences, no distinct vocabulary or rhythm) — cover the
// character names and the lines are not attributable to a specific speaker.
// Meant to read as a plausible early-career draft: the PLOT is coherent and
// the jokes land at a competent level, the voices just never differentiate.

INT. BRIGHTLEAF MARKETING - OPEN OFFICE - MORNING

ALEX TORRES, 20s, JORDAN MBEKI, 20s, and CASEY WREN, 20s, huddle around a laptop displaying an event-planning spreadsheet.

ALEX
Okay, so we got assigned the office party. Honestly? Kind of a lot for three people.

JORDAN
I mean, kind of. Honestly it's fine, we've got a few weeks.

CASEY
Yeah, honestly, a few weeks is fine. I mean, it's not nothing, but it's fine.

INT. BRIGHTLEAF MARKETING - BREAK ROOM - MORNING

The three sit with coffee, scrolling venue options on a shared tablet.

ALEX
This rooftop place looks kind of nice. Honestly, a little pricey though.

JORDAN
Kind of pricey, yeah. I mean, we do have the budget for it, technically.

CASEY
Technically, sure. Honestly I'm fine with pricey if it's actually nice.

INT. BRIGHTLEAF MARKETING - CONFERENCE ROOM - AFTERNOON

A whiteboard reads OFFICE PARTY in someone's uneven handwriting. The three sit around the table with markers.

JORDAN
Okay, catering. Honestly I think we just do the usual sandwich platters.

CASEY
I mean, sandwich platters are fine. Kind of boring, but fine.

ALEX
Kind of boring, yeah, but honestly nobody really complains about sandwiches.

INT. BRIGHTLEAF MARKETING - OPEN OFFICE - AFTERNOON

Casey scrolls a playlist app while Alex and Jordan lean over their shoulder.

CASEY
Okay, what about music. Honestly I was thinking just a general playlist, nothing crazy.

ALEX
A general playlist's fine. I mean, kind of expected, but fine.

JORDAN
Kind of expected, yeah. Honestly that's probably safest anyway.

INT. BRIGHTLEAF MARKETING - SUPPLY CLOSET - DAY

The three dig through bins of leftover decorations from past years.

ALEX
Honestly, half this stuff is from like three parties ago. Kind of sad, actually.

JORDAN
Kind of sad, yeah. I mean, streamers don't really expire though.

CASEY
Technically they don't expire, no. Honestly I say we just reuse what we can.

INT. BRIGHTLEAF MARKETING - CONFERENCE ROOM - DAY

The whiteboard now has a half-finished invite list scrawled on it.

JORDAN
Okay, invite list. Honestly, do we invite the whole floor or just our team.

CASEY
I mean, whole floor feels more fun. Kind of a bigger commitment though.

ALEX
Kind of a bigger commitment, yeah. Honestly I say we just go for it.

INT. BRIGHTLEAF MARKETING - OPEN OFFICE - DAY

Alex checks a budget spreadsheet, brow furrowed, while the other two watch over their shoulder.

ALEX
Okay so honestly, we're a little over budget on the rooftop thing now.

CASEY
Kind of a lot over, actually. I mean, not crazy over, but over.

JORDAN
Not crazy over, yeah. Honestly we can probably trim the catering a bit.

INT. BRIGHTLEAF MARKETING - BREAK ROOM - DAY

The three sit with sandwich menus spread across the table, crossing off options.

CASEY
Okay, honestly, we cut the fancy platter and just do the regular one.

ALEX
Kind of a downgrade, but honestly, fine. Nobody's going to notice that much.

JORDAN
Nobody's going to notice, yeah. I mean, honestly, it's still sandwiches either way.

INT. BRIGHTLEAF MARKETING - OPEN OFFICE - AFTERNOON

A calendar reminder pings on all three of their screens at once: OFFICE PARTY - TOMORROW.

JORDAN
Okay, honestly, that came up fast. Kind of can't believe it's already tomorrow.

CASEY
Kind of can't believe it either. I mean, I think we're actually ready though.

ALEX
Honestly, I think we're ready too. Kind of surprised, but ready.

INT. BRIGHTLEAF MARKETING - ROOFTOP - EVENING

String lights, sandwich platters, and the general playlist all in place. Coworkers mingle while Alex, Jordan, and Casey stand off to the side, surveying it.

CASEY
Honestly? Kind of came together.

ALEX
Kind of did, yeah. I mean, better than I expected, honestly.

JORDAN
Better than expected, for sure. Honestly, not bad for three people and a few weeks.

INT. BRIGHTLEAF MARKETING - ROOFTOP - EVENING (CONTINUOUS)

The three clink plastic cups together, mildly pleased with themselves.

ALEX
Same time next year, I guess.

CASEY
Honestly, sure. Same time next year.

JORDAN
Kind of a tradition now, I guess. Honestly, works for me.
